# Telegram Bot API — free, no paid SMS required
# 1. Open Telegram and chat with @BotFather
# 2. Send /newbot and follow prompts → copy the bot token
# 3. Start a chat with your new bot (or add it to a private group)
# 4. Get your chat id: message @userinfobot or open
#    https://api.telegram.org/bot<YOUR_TOKEN>/getUpdates after sending the bot a message
# 5. Paste values below (never commit real secrets)

TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
